  "description": "Execution history for native Optimizely CMS 13 scheduled jobs. Swap ScheduledJobBase for LoggedScheduledJobBase and every run is recorded: OnStatusChanged messages, the return value, unhandled exceptions, severity-tagged log lines, an optional multi-line result summary, and automatic metrics (duration, allocations, CPU time, GC counts). Stored in EF Core-backed SQL tables and browsable in a Blazor UI embedded in the CMS admin, with an automatic retention cleanup job. Never alters your jobs' success/failure semantics, and an unreachable insights database costs you the history of a run rather than the run itself.",
